+## 2026-10-26 Merging accounts that share an email
+Decision: merge_duplicates groups open accounts by email, case and spaces ignored, and keeps the oldest account (earliest
+`created`) with its email as written. The other accounts are closed (active false, merged_into), their orders move to
+the kept account and their points are added to it.
+Why: the ticket did not say which account wins; docs/data-rules.md keeps every order and every point.
